    "problemName": "sequential-digits",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def sequentialDigits(self, low: int, high: int) -> List[int]:\r\n        ans = []\r\n        for i in range(1, 9):\r\n            x = i\r\n            for j in range(i + 1, 10):\r\n                x = x * 10 + j\r\n                if low <= x <= high:\r\n                    ans.append(x)\r\n        return sorted(ans)",
